cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use SymRISC-32, please cite it as below."
title: "SymRISC-32: a 32-bit RISC instruction set with symbolic mnemonics"
abstract: >-
  A load/store RISC instruction-set architecture with 25 instructions, two
  instruction formats and 64 registers, together with its single-cycle
  datapath design and a reference assembler, disassembler and signal-level
  simulator.
type: software
